- mega-tron - MIT License - https://github.com/mega-edo/mega-tron - pinned commit 0ed290a1df1739af5cf4291d0ad8155afc7af16b
- uv - Apache-2.0 OR MIT - https://github.com/astral-sh/uv - pinned version 0.12.9
